Software dependencies (installed by uv from PyPI and download.pytorch.org)
  PyTorch, Hugging Face transformers and huggingface-hub, NumPy, SciPy, soundfile (libsndfile),
  matplotlib, psutil, threadpoolctl, nvidia-ml-py: each under its own licence.

ASVspoof 5
  Only the published clip counts of the ASVspoof 5 training, development and evaluation sets are
  used, to convert measured speed into minutes per epoch. No ASVspoof data is used or distributed.
